
                DayDream BBS V1.00, MultiNode.DAT Structure
                -------------------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   BYTE       01    NODE NUMBER OR $FF FOR 'USE-FOR-UNKNOWN'-ITEM     (-)
 0001   BYTE       01    NUMBER OF IO-DEVICE.DAT-FILE TO BE USED           (-)
 0002   WORD       02    MINIMUM BAUD RATE TO ALLOW CONNECTION WITH        (-)
 0004   WORD       02    MINIMUM BAUD RATE TO ALLOW NEW USER REGISTRATION  (-)
 0006   ULONG      04    UNUSED
 0010   STRING     19    SCREEN FONT NAME                                  (-)
 0030   WORD       02    SCREEN FONT HEIGHT                                (-)
 0032   BYTE       01    FLAGS                                             (-)
 0033   BYTE       01    OTHER FLAGS                                       (-)
 0034   STRING     31    EXECUTION COMMAND WHEN CLICKED IN SERVER          (-)
 0066   BYTE       01    NODE PRIORITY                                     (-)
 0077	STRING     32    TEMPORARY DIRECTORY                               (-)
 0100   UBYTE      01    PEN #1
 0101   UBYTE      01    PEN #2
 0102   UBYTE      01    PEN #3
 0103   UBYTE      01    PEN #4
 0104   UBYTE      01    PEN #5
 0105   UBYTE      01    PEN #6
 0106   UBYTE      01    PEN #7
 0107   UBYTE      01    PEN #8
 0108   UBYTE      01    PEN #9
 0109   UBYTE      01    PEN #10
 0110   UBYTE      01    PEN #11
 0111   UBYTE      01    PEN #12
 0112   FREE BYTES 88    FREE ...                                          (-)
==============================================================================
 0200

BIT   MEANING WHEN SET AS PRESENTED BELOW                                FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0    0: CUSTOM SCREEN                 1: PUBLIC SCREEN, ALLOW VISITOR WINDOWS
 1    0: USE GLOBAL DISPLAY STUFF      1: USE NODE SPECIFIC DISPLAY STUFF

         -- FOLLOWING TWO ARE GLOBAL DEFINITIONS, NOT JUST DAYDREAM'S --

 2    0: DON'T TOUCH WB WINDOWS        1: CAPTURE WB WINDOWS (SHANGHAI)
 3    0: DON'T ACT WHEN VISITORS OPEN  1: DEF PUB SCR TO FRONT WHEN VISITOR..

                  -- VARIABLES AFFECTING ONLY DAYDREAM --

 4    0: DON'T REACT WHEN CONNECTED    1: SCREEN TO FRONT WHEN CONNECTED
 5    0: DON'T OPEN SCREEN AT START    1: OPEN SCREEN AT START
 6    0: DON'T FIX RED<->WHITE         1: FIX RED<->WHITE
 7    0: USE 8 COLORS                  1: USE 16 COLORS
==============================================================================

BIT   MEANING WHEN SET AS PRESENTED BELOW                           OTHERFLAGS
==============================================================================
 0    0: REGULAR NODE                  1: TELNET NODE
 1    0: DO NOT NOTIFY WHEN CALLER     1: NOTIFY WHEN CALLER
 2    0: SHOW NODE IF INACTIVE         1: HIDE NODE IF INACTIVE
 3    0: SHOW NODE IF WAITING FOR CALL 1: HIDE NODE IF WAITING FOR CALL
 4    0: SHOW NODE IF CALLER ONLINE    1: HIDE NODE WHEN CALLER ONLINE
 5    0: ASK PASSWORDS                 1: DO NOT ASK PASSWORDS
 6    0: USE DEFAULT CONSOLE           1: USE CUSTOM CONSOLE
 7    0: USE 8/16 colours              1: USE 4 COLOURS
==============================================================================
